<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Namibia's CIC maiden results beat forecast.</title>
<headline>Namibia's CIC maiden results beat forecast.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million N$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     18.8	  vs 9.9</p>
<p>    Net profit		19.73	 vs 10.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   21.74	 vs 14.53</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.71	  vs 4.16</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   10.29	 vs 5.73</p>
<p>    Turnover		  607.78	vs 509.48</p>
<p>Full name: CIC Holdings Ltd (packaging and distribution)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company listed on the Namibian Stock Exchange earlier this year. No dividend was declared, as stated in the prospectus.</p>
<p>The company had predicted EPS of 16.9 cents.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
